# Data files
#
# Belt and braces. `data/` alone was not enough: moving the exchange-wide tape
# into `data_fast/` put a 1.08 GB file in front of a commit, and git history is
# forever - deleting it afterwards does not shrink the repo or unblock a push.
# Raw collection output is .jsonl in this project and none of it ever belongs
# in version control, wherever it lands.
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.parquet
*.jsonl
data/
data_*/
logs/

# IDE / Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

